				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-5333129/scp-150#post-4813320</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2020 20:24:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>BetterMyButter</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2818841</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You know how your body sort of, like, recoils, whenever you see or hear something disturbing? I feel this tension in my throat whenever I see those anti-smoking ads with the empty holes in their throat for the device.</p> <p>I felt tension <em>all over</em> while reading this. The worst part was the ending, though, because I wanted more! This is such a cool concept and I was hoping it would be explored further, but the article itself is just the right length.</p> <p>+1 and here's to future squick!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
